@RaceDayAPI_HostAddress = https://localhost:7079

### Register an Organiser
POST {{RaceDayAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Organiser",
  "email": "organiser@test.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!",
  "role": "Organiser",
  "phoneNumber": "0712345678"
}

### Login
POST {{RaceDayAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "organiser@test.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}

### Logout
POST {{RaceDayAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/logout
